A '''cyclops''' (plural ''cyclopes'') is a large one-eyed [[Giant (race)|giant]]. They are known for dropping many [[Alchemy spells|alchable]] drops, so bringing [[nature rune|nature]] and [[fire rune]]s is helpful as it allows players to make longer trips and more money without banking or taking up inventory space. The cyclopes found in the Warriors' Guild were brought over by [[Harrallak Menarous]] from the [[Wushanko Isles]] when he went on an expedition there.

Cyclopes in the [[Warriors' Guild]] have a rare chance of dropping a [[defender]]. These defensive weapons range from [[Bronze defender|bronze]] to [[Dragon defender|dragon]] and must be obtained in order, starting with bronze, by killing cyclopes on the top floor of the Warriors' Guild and then either re-entering the cyclops room with the defender in their inventory or by showing the defender to [[Kamfreena]] outside the chamber. Once a player earns the rune defender, they can enter the basement of the Warriors' Guild and kill the stronger cyclopes found there for a chance at the dragon defender. As this is located in the Warriors' Guild, cyclopes found in these areas are immune to [[Ranged]] and [[Magic]] attacks and must be fought with melee combat. As a result of being immune to Ranged damage, cyclopes are effectively immune to [[burn]], which will be inflicted but reduced to 0 damage.

Cyclopes may be killed as a substitute for [[hill giant]]s on a [[Slayer task]].

